<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>i guess u never really cared about me</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Artemas</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">i guess u never really cared about me</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2hyyp0mZc5QFY5YQeyv7oP</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.150" end="00:06.580">I guess you never really cared, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.580" end="00:08.440">I guess you never really-</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.440" end="00:14.620">Whoo, I guess you never really cared about me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.620" end="00:19.920">Never really cared about me at all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.920" end="00:25.480">You never got excited like I did (yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.480" end="00:31.670">Whoo, I guess you never really cared about me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.670" end="00:36.940">Never really cared about me at all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.940" end="00:43.060">You never got excited like I did (yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.060" end="00:47.350">I made you weak, I pulled your hair</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.350" end="00:51.340">You like it rough and insincere</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.340" end="00:55.700">Up against the wall so the world can hear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.700" end="00:59.360">'Cause I paid your rent, and I fucked you good, and you disappeared</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.360" end="01:03.610">Ooh, You've seen her, I, I, I want you, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.610" end="01:10.770">Ooh, I need you, I, I, I want you to get rough with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.770" end="01:14.430">I like it when you're rough with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.430" end="01:16.480" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I guess you never really)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.480" end="01:22.610">Whoo, I guess you never really cared about me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.610" end="01:27.940">Never really cared about me at all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.940" end="01:33.220">You never got excited like I did (yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.220" end="01:39.610">Whoo, I guess you never really cared about me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.610" end="01:44.860">Never really cared about me at all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.860" end="01:52.660">You never got excited like I did (yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.660" end="01:56.950">I want it to get ugly</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.950" end="02:01.410">I want you to get ugly</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.410" end="02:04.770">You can't help yourself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.770" end="02:07.120">Self, self, self, self</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.120" end="02:11.590">Ooh, You've seen her, I, I, I want you, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.590" end="02:18.630">Ooh, I need you, I, I, I want you to get rough with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.630" end="02:21.320">I like it when you're rough with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.320" end="02:24.370" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I guess you never really cared, baby)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.370" end="02:30.690">Whoo, I guess you never really cared about me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.690" end="02:35.700">Never really cared about me at all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.700" end="02:41.210">You never got excited like I did (yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.210" end="02:47.420">Whoo, I guess you never really cared about me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.420" end="02:52.720">Never really cared about me at all</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.720" end="02:58.200">You never got excited like I did (yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.200" end="03:02.200" /></div></body></tt>